    a()
except:
    pass
print("b")
try:
    b()
except:
    pass
```
https://play.ruff.rs/30554c6e-ac10-4521-9805-b1b518b96bed

TRY203 will suggest to rewrite `a()` as `b()`, but this changes behavior. We should noqa this case, but I believe that _any_ try block with a `finally` should not have TRY203 flag it.

